const STOPWORDS = new Set( `a an and are as at be but by for from how if in into is it its of on or that the their then there these this to was were what when where which who will with you your` .split(/\s+/) .filter(Boolean), );
Deliberately short. An aggressive stopword list hurts technical queries, where
words like "get", "set" and "run" carry real meaning.

